# The root module's requires, exactly: path version [indirect]. check.sh's deps step compares go.mod's Require
# list with these lines (sorted) and fails on any difference or on any replace. blake2b (screen's hashes, #6)
# needs x/crypto; its blake2b imports golang.org/x/sys/cpu. Versions (#15, docs/decisions/0008-go-floor.md): the
# newest x/crypto whose go.mod fits the go line (go 1.27.0) and that was at least 14 days old on the day of the
# bump, and the x/sys it requires. Bumped 2026-11-13: v0.58.0 (2026-10-09, go 1.26.0) and x/sys v0.49.0
# (2026-10-06); v0.59.0 (2026-11-11) was too new.
golang.org/x/crypto v0.58.0
golang.org/x/sys v0.49.0 indirect
